sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant API as Perry.Api
  participant JWT as JwtBearer
  participant S as Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  C->>API: HTTP /api/...
  API->>JWT: validate Bearer?
  alt invalid / missing when required
    JWT-->>C: 401
  else ok
    JWT-->>API: claims
    API->>S: business call
    S->>DB: EF Core
    DB-->>S: data
    S-->>API: DTO
    API-->>C: JSON 200
  end
